++- The MMC backport uses spacemit-com/uboot-2022.10 at 289dc2b7bd25bf9d88ce9e7e263e95234868ca14.
++- Linux uses vendor linux-6.18 at 7d17e358c660f1046eb1f27f26eea33955813afd for display and GPU drivers.
++- OpenSBI uses vendor-hosted integration at 13a401f8ce4963b1e20d7685b806086bb8f5c4c8.
++- PowerVR firmware uses upstream linux-firmware at bcf20866cf559c19e6f33b10266fde45013e60b6.
